\@writefile{lof}{\contentsline {figure}{\numberline {S8}{\ignorespaces  Barker et al. D-O warming catalogue sensitivity. (a--c) Precession-phase Rayleigh tests for the \citet  {barker2011800} variable-threshold D-O warming catalogue under three age/support choices; arrows show the mean resultant direction and dashed circles mark the \(p=0.05\) threshold. (d) Nested likelihood-ratio tests shown as \(-\log _{10}(p)\); the dashed line marks \(p=0.05\). (e) \(\Delta \)AICc, defined as full minus reduced model for each row; negative values favour the fuller model. (f) Predictive-information gain in bits per event for the same full-versus-reduced comparison. For each row, the reduced model is specified by the ``after'' phrase: the EDC event-process baseline for the climate-state model, the Barker climate-state model for precession phase, and the EDC event-process baseline for the full predictive model. }}{11}{}\protected@file@percent }
